          "The 6 middleware tests are 'blocked', a status TestSprite uses for a run that errors before assertions."
        ],
        "fix": "Normalise defensively in the shared preamble: build the header dict from __AUTH_CREDENTIAL__ (which is a plain string and is already proven to work - subject() parses it successfully in the cloud) and use __AUTH_HEADERS__ only when it is already a Mapping.",
