        "mechanism": "IDENTITY_VERIFIER=jwks makes the tool server fetch Auth0's JWKS on first verification. If that fetch fails or is slow from the host behind the tunnel, verification fails and the kernel returns an empty tool catalogue rather than an error - by design, so the catalogue cannot be probed. Every authenticated test then fails with a shape assertion instead of an auth error.",
